sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Người dân
  participant APP as Mobile App
  participant API as S.O.S Aid Backend
  participant OP as Operator/Bác sĩ trực
  participant VID as Video Service
  participant DSP as Dispatch/Crew
  participant NOTI as Notification
  U->>APP: Bấm S.O.S
  APP->>API: POST /emergency-cases + GPS + Idempotency-Key
  API-->>APP: caseId, code, status=QUEUED
  API-->>OP: Realtime event case.created
  APP->>API: Submit triage observations
  OP->>API: Accept case
  APP->>API: Request video token
  OP->>API: Request video token
  API->>VID: Create/join secure room
  VID-->>APP: WebRTC media
  VID-->>OP: WebRTC media
  OP->>API: Dispatch ambulance/local responder
  API-->>DSP: Assignment + location + case summary
  API->>NOTI: Notify emergency contacts
  DSP->>API: EN_ROUTE -> ON_SCENE
  OP->>API: Finalize handover package
  API-->>DSP: Handover data
  DSP->>API: HANDED_OVER
  OP->>API: CLOSED
